    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«To be» does exist in the past",
     "texto": [
      "In many sentences about identity or location, **быть** is left out in the present (**Я дома** = I am at home) and appears in the past: **был** (masculine), **была** (feminine), **было** (neuter), **были** (plural).",
      "**Где ты был?** = where were you? **Я была дома** = I was at home (said by a woman).",
      "In impersonal expressions the neuter form is used: **Было интересно** = it was interesting."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "When",
     "texto": [
      "**Вчера** = yesterday. **На прошлой неделе** = last week. **Весь день** = all day. **Вечером** = in the evening."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
